 physical violence threats made by disgruntled contractor following termination notice.", "investigation_process": "Preserved raw chat transcripts, confirmed physical presence of targeted victim in Building B, coordinated with Corporate Security on site.", "actions_taken": "Immediately deactivated building badge access, revoked Okta SSO and corporate VPN, dispatched onsite security to escort individual, notified local law enforcement.", "successful_resolution": "Threat neutralized without injury; individual removed from premises; all digital credentials permanently terminated.", "analyst_feedback": "Rapid coordination between DLP chat monitoring and physical badge deprovisioning prevented physical harm.", "lessons_learned": "Integrate real-time DLP keyword alerts directly with automated building badge lockouts for immediate threat mitigation.", "post_mortem_information": "Post-Mortem: INC-2026-0835 - Threat to Life & Workplace Safety Alert: Violent Statement in Internal Channel. Root Cause: Workplace hostility and severe physical violence threats made by disgruntled contractor following termination notice.. Resolution: Threat neutralized without injury; individual removed from premises; all digital credentials permanently terminated."}], "memory_augmented": true}', 'hs-bank-INC-2026-1043');
