t-Mortem: INC-2026-0837 - Hostile Extortion & Physical Harm Threat in IT Helpdesk Portal. Root Cause: Adversary attempting social engineering intimidation and physical violence threats to force support staff to bypass account verification.. Resolution: Support staff safe; no unauthorized data released; perimeter filtering blocked subsequent attack attempts."}], "memory_augmented": true}', NULL);
