anagement escalation protocol", "Preserve all device forensic images and communication history (proven in INC-2026-1038)", "Conduct urgent out-of-band safety check with reported victim"], "reason_for_recommendation": "Previous incident INC-2026-1038 demonstrated that rapid physical badge suspension and law enforcement/HR escalation mitigated workplace threats immediately.", "historical_evidence": "In historical incident ''Toxic Workplace Communication & Abusive Harassment'' (INC-2026-1038), early physical and digital isolation prevented physical harm and insider sabotage.", "prevention_suggestions": ["Implement automated DLP and communication monitoring for threat-to-life keywords", "Provide annual workplace violence prevention and anonymous whistleblower channels", "Integrate HR alerting with physical badge and SSO automated deprovisioning"], "similar_historical_incidents": [{"id": "INC-2026-1038", "title": "Toxic Workplace Communication & Abusive Harassment", "type": "Physical Threat & Hostile Statement", "similarity": "98%", "similarity_score": 0.98, "root_cause": "Direct threat to life, workplace hostility, or malicious insider intent detected in user communications.", "investigation_process": null, "actions_taken": "Approved and applied recommended perimeter firewall rules, rotated credentials, and enabled MFA.", "successful_resolution": "Mitigation verified; zero unauthorized persistence detected.", "analyst_feedback": "AI recommendation approved by SOC Analyst.", "lessons_learned": "Enforce key-only authentication with continuous port exposure monitoring.", "post_mortem_information": "Post-Mortem: INC-2026-1038 - Toxic Workplace Communication & Abusive Harassment. Root Cause: Direct threat to life, workplace hostility, or malicious insider intent detected in user communications.. Resolution: Mitigation verified; zero unauthorized persistence detected."}, {"id": "INC-2026-1037", "title": "M SRI HARI ", "type": "Physical Threat & Hostile Statement", "similarity": "98%", "similarity_score": 0.98, "root_cause": "Direct threat to life, workplace hostility, or malicious insider intent detected in user communications.", "investigation_process": null, "actions_taken": "Approved and applied recommended perimeter firewall rules, rotated credentials, and enabled MFA.", "successful_resolution": "Mitigation verified; zero unauthorized persistence detected.", "analyst_feedback": "AI recommendation approved by SOC Analyst.", "lessons_learned": "Enforce key-only authentication with continuous port exposure monitoring.", "post_mortem_information": "Post-Mortem: INC-2026-1037 - M SRI HARI . Root Cause: Direct threat to life, workplace hostility, or malicious insider intent detected in user communications.. Resolution: Mitigation verified; zero unauthorized persistence detected."}, {"id": "INC-2026-1033", "title": "M SRI HARI ", "type": "Physical Threat & Hostile Statement", "similarity": "98%", "similarity_score": 0.98, "root_cause": "Potential misconfiguration, credential exposure, or perimeter control gap.", "investigation_process": null, "actions_taken": "Approved and applied recommended perimeter firewall rules, rotated credentials, and enabled MFA.", "successful_resolution": "Mitigation verified; zero unauthorized persistence detected.", "analyst_feedback": "AI recommendation approved by SOC Analyst.", "lessons_learned": "Enforce key-only authentication with continuous port exposure monitoring.", "post_mortem_information": "Post-Mortem: INC-2026-1033 - M SRI HARI . Root Cause: Potential misconfiguration, credential exposure, or perimeter control gap.. Resolution: Mitigation verified; zero unauthorized persistence detected."}], "memory_augmented": true}', NULL);
